    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MAJOR UPDATE (JANUARY 2025)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello Go-Kart Drivers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After more than seven years of the release of Go-Kart Racing on Steam,\u00a0 I am proud to announce a <strong><u>MAJOR</u></strong> update for the game that will be available immediately! There's a long list of updates,\u00a0 so feel free to take a look below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Update Notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HDRP Added to Rendering and Major Graphics Overhaul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three Reimagined HDRP Race Tracks Replace the Original Lower-Quality Tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Major AI Driving Overhauls Increase AI Knowledge and Competitiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aerodynamic Drafting System with Slipstream Effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reimagined Karting Physics and Updated Racing Physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completely New UI Interface for Cleaner Presentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Results Screen with More Data</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Added Difficulty Settings for AI Drivers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated Steering Wheel with New Onboard Camera\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And MUCH More!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go-Kart Racing provides racers with a thrilling go-kart racing experience. Compete against drivers out on the race track to prove that you are the fastest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience high speeds, big karting crashes, and exhilaration as you battle your way through the pack and compete for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Race against several other AI Drivers out on the track. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Race on 3 challenging Go-Kart race tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Customize your Go-Kart Paint Livery. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Earn Steam Achievements as you complete races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Compete on the Steam Leaderboards to earn the best finish.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>QUICK RACES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Customize the length of your own races on three different racetracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Compete in quick races to practice and improve your speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COMPETITIVE AI RACING</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AI Drivers will compete on the racetrack and look for the best opportunities to pass each other during each race event. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At each event, some AI Drivers may have more competitive cars depending on their performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Gamepad Controllers are recommended for the greatest driving experience. </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MAJOR UPDATE (JANUARY 2025)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello Go-Kart Drivers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After more than seven years of the release of Go-Kart Racing on Steam,\u00a0 I am proud to announce a <strong><u>MAJOR</u></strong> update for the game that will be available immediately! There's a long list of updates,\u00a0 so feel free to take a look below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Update Notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HDRP Added to Rendering and Major Graphics Overhaul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three Reimagined HDRP Race Tracks Replace the Original Lower-Quality Tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Major AI Driving Overhauls Increase AI Knowledge and Competitiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aerodynamic Drafting System with Slipstream Effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reimagined Karting Physics and Updated Racing Physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completely New UI Interface for Cleaner Presentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Results Screen with More Data</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Added Difficulty Settings for AI Drivers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated Steering Wheel with New Onboard Camera\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And MUCH More!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go-Kart Racing provides racers with a thrilling go-kart racing experience. Compete against drivers out on the race track to prove that you are the fastest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience high speeds, big karting crashes, and exhilaration as you battle your way through the pack and compete for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Race against several other AI Drivers out on the track. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Race on 3 challenging Go-Kart race tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Customize your Go-Kart Paint Livery. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Earn Steam Achievements as you complete races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Compete on the Steam Leaderboards to earn the best finish.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>QUICK RACES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Customize the length of your own races on three different racetracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Compete in quick races to practice and improve your speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COMPETITIVE AI RACING</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AI Drivers will compete on the racetrack and look for the best opportunities to pass each other during each race event. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At each event, some AI Drivers may have more competitive cars depending on their performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Gamepad Controllers are recommended for the greatest driving experience. </strong></p>",
